    {
      "body": "+1 from B70: we carry this in b70.6 of our engine kit (https://github.com/Lumnus/b70-flash-next/releases/tag/v0.32.0-b70.6), for GDN with several KV cache groups on 4 × Arc Pro B70, and those engines pass our concurrency and determinism gates. It would be one less local pick for us.\n\nAI assistance (Claude) was used to draft this comment.\n",
